---
// Hero section - Above the fold
---

<section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-900 to-gray-800 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <!-- Pain-driven badge -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 mb-8">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-red-400 opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-red-500"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="text-red-300 text-sm font-medium">Americans lose $16B in unused warranties every year</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Headline -->
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Stop throwing money away<br />
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary">
          on forgotten warranties
        </span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Subheadline -->
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        That $1,200 dishwasher broke 3 weeks after the warranty expired.
        Sound familiar? HavenKeep makes sure it never happens again.
      </p>

      <!-- CTAs. The "Protect" button anchors to the App Store / Play Store
           badges directly below — there's no consumer web signup yet, so
           sending users into a dead app.havenkeep.com flow is broken. -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mb-6">
        <a href="#download-hero" class="btn-primary text-lg px-8 py-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
          Protect My Warranties &mdash; Free
        </a>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn-secondary text-lg px-8 py-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          See How It Works
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- App Store Buttons -->
      <div id="download-hero" class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-6">
        <a
          href="https://apps.apple.com/app/havenkeep"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-black hover:bg-gray-800 text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-700 transition-colors"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 17 2.94 12.45 4.7 9.39c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.81-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M13 3.5c.73-.83 1.94-1.46 2.94-1.5.13 1.17-.34 2.35-1.04 3.19-.69.85-1.83 1.51-2.95 1.42-.15-1.15.41-2.35 1.05-3.11z"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="text-left">
            <div class="text-[10px] leading-none opacity-80">Download on the</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold leading-tight">App Store</div>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=app.havenkeep.mobile"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-black hover:bg-gray-800 text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-700 transition-colors"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3.609 1.814L13.792 12 3.61 22.186a.996.996 0 01-.61-.92V2.734a1 1 0 01.609-.92zm10.89 10.893l2.302 2.302-10.937 6.333 8.635-8.635zm3.199-3.198l2.807 1.626a1 1 0 010 1.73l-2.808 1.626L15.206 12l2.492-2.491zM5.864 2.658L16.8 8.99l-2.302 2.302-8.634-8.634z"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="text-left">
            <div class="text-[10px] leading-none opacity-80">Get it on</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold leading-tight">Google Play</div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Audit Ch10-W108: previously claimed "60-second setup" — there was
           no measurement behind that. Replaced with honest copy. -->
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-12">No credit card required &bull; Free forever for up to 5 items &bull; Quick to get started</p>

      <!-- Trust Signals -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-8 text-sm text-gray-300 mb-16">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.166 4.999A11.954 11.954 0 0010 1.944 11.954 11.954 0 0017.834 5c.11.65.166 1.32.166 2.001 0 5.225-3.34 9.67-8 11.317C5.34 16.67 2 12.225 2 7c0-.682.057-1.35.166-2.001zm11.541 3.708a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
          <span><strong>AES-256</strong> encrypted</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:block w-px h-4 bg-gray-700"></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" />
          </svg>
          <span><strong>iOS &amp; Android</strong> apps</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:block w-px h-4 bg-gray-700"></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
          <span><strong>Quick</strong> setup</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Phone mockup. HavenKeep is mobile-only today (iOS + Android), so
         the hero shows a phone instead of a fictional desktop dashboard. -->
    <div class="max-w-sm mx-auto">
      <div class="relative">
        <!-- Glow effect -->
        <div class="absolute -inset-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/20 via-secondary/20 to-primary/20 rounded-[3rem] blur-2xl"></div>

        <!-- Phone frame -->
        <div class="relative rounded-[2.5rem] border-[10px] border-gray-800 bg-gray-900 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden">
          <!-- Notch -->
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-32 h-6 bg-gray-800 rounded-b-2xl z-10"></div>

          <!-- Status bar -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-6 pt-3 pb-2 bg-gray-900 text-white text-xs">
            <span class="font-medium">9:41</span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M17.778 8.222c-4.296-4.296-11.26-4.296-15.556 0A1 1 0 01.808 6.808c5.076-5.076 13.308-5.076 18.384 0a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414zM14.95 11.05a7 7 0 00-9.9 0 1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414 9 9 0 0112.728 0 1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414zM12.12 13.88a3 3 0 00-4.242 0 1 1 0 01-1.415-1.415 5 5 0 017.072 0 1 1 0 01-1.415 1.415zM9 16a1 1 0 011-1h.01a1 1 0 110 2H10a1 1 0 01-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 4.75A.75.75 0 012.75 4h14.5a.75.75 0 01.75.75v10.5a.75.75 0 01-.75.75H2.75a.75.75 0 01-.75-.75V4.75z" /></svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Screen content -->
          <div class="px-5 pt-3 pb-6">
            <!-- Header -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">My Warranties</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">3 expiring soon</p>
              </div>
              <button class="w-9 h-9 bg-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" aria-label="Add item">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4" /></svg>
              </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Stats row -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mb-5">
              <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-3 border border-gray-700">
                <p class="text-base font-bold text-white">24</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">Items</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-3 border border-gray-700">
                <p class="text-base font-bold text-accent">$8,420</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">Protected</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-3 border border-yellow-600/30">
                <p class="text-base font-bold text-yellow-400">3</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">Expiring</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item list -->
            <div class="space-y-2.5">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-gray-800/50 rounded-lg p-3 border border-red-500/30">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-red-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-2.5L13.732 4c-.77-.833-1.964-.833-2.732 0L4.082 16.5c-.77.833.192 2.5 1.732 2.5z" /></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                  <p class="text-xs font-medium text-white truncate">Samsung Dishwasher</p>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-red-400">Expires in 5 days</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-gray-800/50 rounded-lg p-3 border border-yellow-500/20">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-yellow-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-yellow-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                  <p class="text-xs font-medium text-white truncate">LG 65&rdquo; OLED TV</p>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-yellow-400">Expires in 23 days</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-gray-800/50 rounded-lg p-3 border border-gray-700">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-accent/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                  <p class="text-xs font-medium text-white truncate">MacBook Pro 16&rdquo; M3</p>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">Expires Dec 2026</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
